    {
      "subId": "602804",
      "subQuestName": "Discuss what to do with your companions",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "60280301"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "60280301": {
            "id": "60280301",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Lauma",
            "text": "Are you alright? Do your wounds still hurt?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "60280302"
            ]
          },
          "60280302": {
            "id": "60280302",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "60280303"
            ]
          },
          "60280303": {
            "id": "60280303",
            "speakerId": 1004,
            "speakerName": "Nefer",
            "text": "I had someone prepare a little medicine that could prove effective. Take it if you need to.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "60280306"
            ]
          },
          "60280306": {
            "id": "60280306",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Durin",
            "text": "In that case, let me relate the contents of the call we made to Alice after the incident occurred.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "60280307"
            ]
          },
          "60280307": {
            "id": "60280307",
            "speakerId": 1006,
            "speakerName": "Alice",
            "text": "That Dottore is a crafty one... He distracted the Hexenzirkel by creating a huge fuss at Teyvat's borders.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "60280308"
            ]
          },
          "60280308": {
            "id": "60280308",
            "speakerId": 1006,
            "speakerName": "Alice",
            "text": "I'd assumed that the cause was an Abyssal intrusion from the outside world — which, in fairness, is a rather common occurrence.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "60280309"
            ]
          },
          "60280309": {
            "id": "60280309",
            "speakerId": 1006,
            "speakerName": "Alice",
            "text": "But after learning that you managed to influence the phantoms in Nod-Krai, I realized that perhaps this interference could have come from within Teyvat instead.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "60280310"
            ]
          },
          "60280310": {
            "id": "60280310",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Durin",
            "text": "But we weren't able to change their fates...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "60280311"
            ]
          },
          "60280311": {
            "id": "60280311",
            "speakerId": 1006,
            "speakerName": "Alice",
            "text": "True, you couldn't change how their stories ended. But you did build some \"variables\" around yourself.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "60280312"
            ]
          },
          "60280312": {
            "id": "60280312",
            "speakerId": 1007,
            "speakerName": "Wanderer",
            "text": "Variables?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "60280313"
            ]
          },
          "60280313": {
            "id": "60280313",
            "speakerId": 1006,
            "speakerName": "Alice",
            "text": "Yes — things you heard that you could not otherwise have learned, ideas that would otherwise have never crossed your mind... All these things are \"variables.\"",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "60280314"
            ]
          },
          "60280314": {
            "id": "60280314",
            "speakerId": 1006,
            "speakerName": "Alice",
            "text": "Of course, most variables usually pale into insignificance with the myriad of possibilities floating around. But the moment you start treating them as building blocks and intentionally stacking them, that changes things.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "60280315"
            ]
          },
          "60280315": {
            "id": "60280315",
            "speakerId": 1006,
            "speakerName": "Alice",
            "text": "That's what Dottore did, and it's how he created the necessary conditions so that when you activated the portal tonight, it played right into his plan.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "60280316"
            ]
          },
          "60280316": {
            "id": "60280316",
            "speakerId": 1008,
            "speakerName": "Nicole",
            "text": "However, we have no way of knowing exactly what he did.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "60280317"
            ]
          },
          "60280317": {
            "id": "60280317",
            "speakerId": 1009,
            "speakerName": "Varka",
            "text": "Yeah. We also need to ascertain Columbina's status.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "60280318"
            ]
          },
          "60280318": {
            "id": "60280318",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Durin",
            "text": "And that about sums it up.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "60280319"
            ]
          },
          "60280319": {
            "id": "60280319",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "The Knave",
            "text": "As I suspected, Dottore has disappeared completely. If it's any consolation, he wasn't able to control Columbina as he might have wished to.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "60280320"
            ]
          },
          "60280320": {
            "id": "60280320",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "I'm afraid that's small consolation, given the reason why...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "60280321"
            ]
          },
          "60280321": {
            "id": "60280321",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Oh no..."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "602805",
      "subQuestName": "Go outside and gaze at the moon",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
